    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f0c18707de384fb2aaa2988ca630b269",
      "statement": "A pydantic ValidationError raised while validating the payload DTO is converted to InvalidParams (-32602) rather than propagating; json_safe_validation_errors round-trips error.errors() through json.dumps(default=str) because pydantic stores the raw exception in ctx.error for value_error types (a rejecting ValueObject validate_fn), which would otherwise crash the host's json.dumps instead of returning the error envelope. This is also what lets a rejected ValueObject stay JSON-safe in the reply.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/rpc/jrpc.py#L42-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:436f2b6a974912f14c8f55019670ccf7ac8e6a88cc7bf35d7ccd9b5c72fd63bf:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/rpc/jrpc.py#L90-L93",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b595a75f28e6093c64ce381c77404c99ac50fcb3cc8b5f10e78f7fa2d56c912d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://tests/entrypoint/test_entrypoint_rpc.py#L239-L257",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:807fe67f97030fcef3dfd94219e1295e33ff8889c1b34d00ffb60f9d84effcd5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d3dc56c903d445798a4bc6087956bb84",
      "statement": "Any exception other than MethodNotFound or InvalidParams becomes -32603 Internal error whose data is only str(error); the failure is logged with logger.exception(\"JSON-RPC method [%s] failed\", method), so the traceback stays in the log and not on the wire.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/rpc/jrpc.py#L129-L132",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fcf4b0651ef0d14de330d1e0d7f1c95d0855a7725f49ba4504c3bb16fb4782e0:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_617b2191544a4ac6a73bf637be56351c",
      "statement": "Notifications are detected by the absence of an id member, not by a null id: the method still executes, but handle_single returns None for every outcome including -32601, -32602 and -32603, so a notification never produces a reply.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/rpc/jrpc.py#L110-L115",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f5fef1f00db2340faba68909317a150100d2ed93d71605ce58b6001c4895400c:"
