    {
      "id": "claim_7bab5c9d86224646a5bd7a47bd59eb30",
      "statement": "Each published OpenRPC method object carries summary (first line of the description) and description resolved by introspection from docstrings, tags for the alias and the layer, paramStructure \"by-name\", params as content descriptors (name, required, schema) generated from the DTO's JSON Schema in pydantic's property order, a loose {\"name\": \"result\", \"schema\": {\"type\": \"object\"}} result, and the vendor extensions x-sincpro-instance / x-sincpro-layer / x-sincpro-dto.",
      "evidence": [
