          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f5686485e813fc021a09e1704f21003db583a05687299cf327231606d231b88a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_146ce9f73a81451a949e76c0f3ae8012",
      "statement": "RpcGateway.app() returns a Starlette application with exactly two routes: POST /rpc and GET /openrpc.json. The async rpc_endpoint awaits the body, folds headers, and then calls the synchronous gateway.handle inline, so dispatch runs on the event loop rather than being offloaded to a threadpool; there is no async bus path in this host.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/rpc/entrypoint.py#L116-L153",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9d1a1d998becee2b7ceda51cf3d21fda6615bd8da0ab5c43f668a4fd0567d5f2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bc07fcaa47ec415f8369c8b2039da23c",
      "statement": "HTTP status codes are narrow by design: an undecodable body returns -32700 Parse error with HTTP 200 (the error travels in the JSON-RPC envelope, and an empty body decodes to null and is answered as -32600 \"Request must be an object\"), a None dispatch result — a lone notification or an all-notification batch — returns an empty 204, and every other reply is a 200 JSONResponse. The app adds no authentication, CORS or size limits.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/rpc/entrypoint.py#L131-L153",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:660eeb03fa8ac822cece3741a352240f1fc3d25486ddd01edaa35a103084496e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/rpc/jrpc.py#L103-L104",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ba22ec99aecd8924fad58d27cf5bc768b25cf24d96b7c5e14161d61ece24eeca:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_eec59fbff3b342768c663f0c1e016264",
      "statement": "Starlette and uvicorn are imported lazily inside app() and run(), never at module import, so methods()/discover()/handle() work without the extra; a missing extra raises ImportError chained from the original one with the message \"Starlette/uvicorn is not installed. Install with: pip install sincpro-framework[rpc]\".",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/entrypoints/rpc/entrypoint.py#L116-L127",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8838d327d292e1c2ca509a528b47752073798311c2c3ca70daa161f31f1fae51:"
        },
        {
